there's something wrong.

00:02:53.884 --> 00:02:57.273
And basically goes about
trying to change everything.

00:02:57.273 --> 00:02:58.106
- Yes.

00:02:58.106 --> 00:03:00.442
- [Interviewer] Why did you focus on him?

00:03:00.442 --> 00:03:02.837
- Because I was working on something else.

00:03:02.837 --> 00:03:04.936
I needed to learn what
high frequency trading was.

00:03:04.936 --> 00:03:07.093
I mean this is a term of art that really

00:03:07.093 --> 00:03:09.503
didn't even exist until
three or four years ago.

00:03:09.503 --> 00:03:13.000
And it was, my ignorance
was deep on the subject

00:03:13.000 --> 00:03:15.480
and I asked big investors
if they could point me

00:03:15.480 --> 00:03:17.181
