00:03:26.521 --> 00:03:27.927
And so you got to go see him."

00:03:27.927 --> 00:03:30.268
And I went to see him just
really on background to see,

00:03:30.268 --> 00:03:31.739
his name is Brad Castillano,

00:03:31.739 --> 00:03:34.325
to see what he could teach me about this.

00:03:34.325 --> 00:03:37.423
And it turned out that he was
engaged in this essentially

00:03:37.423 --> 00:03:40.750
attempt to reform Wall Street from within

00:03:40.750 --> 00:03:44.745
to kind of discover what was
wrong with the stock market.

00:03:44.745 --> 00:03:47.514
How predictory activity has
arisen in the stock market,

00:03:47.514 --> 00:03:49.391
that he had been on the wrong end of.

00:03:49.391 --> 00:03:51.136
And then educating American investors

00:03:51.136 --> 00:03:53.087
about what was happening.

00:03:53.087 --> 00:03:55.613
